  "contentHtml": "\n                      <div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">金村ブログ更新のお時間ですよ〜</span><span class=\"s2\">🔔</span><span class=\"s3\">*</span><span class=\"s1\">゜</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kanemura.miku/2020-01-09/32226_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6811.jpeg\"></span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">チケット申し込みのお知らせです</span><span class=\"s2\">🐳</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">まず</span><span class=\"s3\">1</span><span class=\"s1\">つ目は、『</span><span class=\"s4\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">日向坂</span><span class=\"s5\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">46×DASADA LIVE &amp; FASHION SHOW</span><span class=\"s1\">』です！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\">2020</span><span class=\"s1\">年</span><span class=\"s3\">1</span><span class=\"s1\">月</span><span class=\"s3\">15</span><span class=\"s1\">日から日本テレビさんで放送される「</span><span class=\"s3\">DASADA</span><span class=\"s1\">」とコラボレーションしたランウェイ</span><span class=\"s3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"s1\">ライブという一石二鳥のステージになっております</span><span class=\"s2\">👗✨</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">私もどんな感じになるのかすごくワクワクしています！可愛いお洋服着れるかな〜</span><span class=\"s6\">⁉</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">日程と会場は以下の通りになります</span><span class=\"s3\">↓</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">【日程】</span><span class=\"s3\">2020</span><span class=\"s1\">年</span><span class=\"s3\">2</span><span class=\"s1\">月</span><span class=\"s3\">4</span><span class=\"s1\">日</span><span class=\"s3\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">火</span><span class=\"s3\">) 5</span><span class=\"s1\">日</span><span class=\"s3\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">水</span><span class=\"s3\">)</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">【会場】横浜アリーナ</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">ゼロチケ・ローチケ二次先行予約が</span></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s7\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">1</span><span class=\"s8\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">月</span><span class=\"s7\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">9</span><span class=\"s8\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">日</span